{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9535d58772eeab53","name":"Prototype General Template","source":{"id":"source:reference-9535d58772eeab53","title":"Prototype General Template","revision":19289,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:40:15Z","sha256":"6efc18a5ac78657f8615dc666b572e561e7c0c2a45e3c49e3c92ac03172133bc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19289","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Prototype%20General%20Template&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9535d58772eeab53","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Applicable To:"]}," Any Armor, Any Weapon\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Prototype items are unstable and not ready for release to the general public, but they might have properties that other items do not.  \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapons:"]}," Prototype Weapons can have two traits from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tech Specialist"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tech_Specialist","referenceId":"reference:62e86e4173a4731b"}," feat instead of just one. However, a Prototype Weapon treats a natural roll of 1, 2, 3, or 4 as though it were a Natural 1 (thus, automatically missing), and the Prototype Weapon becomes disabled until it is repaired.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Armors:"]}," Prototype Armor can have two traits from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tech Specialist"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tech_Specialist","referenceId":"reference:62e86e4173a4731b"}," feat instead of just one. However, a wearer of Prototype Armor takes 1 more die of damage from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," (before multiplying); thus, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:7fb29dca115dd7cd"}," that scores a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," against a target wearing Prototype Armor deals 4d8 base damage, which is then doubled.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
